{
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "room",
   "seq": 1,
   "label": "The question",
   "cues": [],
   "lines": [
    {
     "line_id": "v4-2",
     "text": "Quick question before we start.",
     "start_sec": 0.14,
     "end_sec": 2.017,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-3",
     "text": "If Spotify charged you one more dollar a month, would you cancel?",
     "start_sec": 2.297,
     "end_sec": 6.052,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-4",
     "text": "Most people wouldn't. Some would.",
     "start_sec": 6.332,
     "end_sec": 8.359,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-5",
     "text": "And that gap is the whole project.",
     "start_sec": 8.639,
     "end_sec": 10.687,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-6",
     "text": "Picture a room with a hundred people in it, all paying eleven ninety-nine.",
     "start_sec": 11.487,
     "end_sec": 15.753,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-7",
     "text": "We raise it to twelve ninety-nine.",
     "start_sec": 16.033,
     "end_sec": 18.017,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-8",
     "text": "If ninety-five people stay, we make more money.",
     "start_sec": 18.297,
     "end_sec": 21.156,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-9",
     "text": "But if ninety-two stay, we actually make less.",
     "start_sec": 21.436,
     "end_sec": 24.273,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-10",
     "text": "So a dollar's only worth it when fewer than eight people walk out of the room.",
     "start_sec": 24.553,
     "end_sec": 28.841,
     "context_point_id": null
    }
   ],
   "audio_duration_sec": 29.241,
   "segment_combined_audio_url": "static/kickoff/spotify-v4/room.mp3",
   "film_at": 3.084
  },
  {
   "id": "problem",
   "seq": 2,
   "label": "Problem",
   "cues": [],
   "lines": [
    {
     "line_id": "v4-11",
     "text": "Now, last year Spotify raised Premium in six markets.",
     "start_sec": 0.4,
     "end_sec": 4.07,
     "context_point_id": "six_markets"
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-12",
     "text": "The US, Mexico, Brazil, the UK, Germany, and India.",
     "start_sec": 4.35,
     "end_sec": 8.104,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-13",
     "text": "Six rooms.",
     "start_sec": 8.384,
     "end_sec": 9.43,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-14",
     "text": "In some, almost nobody left. In others, people walked.",
     "start_sec": 9.71,
     "end_sec": 13.464,
     "context_point_id": "mixed_reaction"
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-15",
     "text": "And leadership wants to know which room we raise next, and by how much.",
     "start_sec": 13.744,
     "end_sec": 17.776,
     "context_point_id": "where_next"
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-16",
     "text": "Here's the catch. Nobody can answer that yet, 'cause the data's a mess.",
     "start_sec": 18.576,
     "end_sec": 22.864,
     "context_point_id": "messy_data"
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-17",
     "text": "We pulled the raw export, and there are ten things wrong with it.",
     "start_sec": 23.144,
     "end_sec": 26.43,
     "context_point_id": "ten_issues"
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-18",
     "text": "Negative prices.",
     "start_sec": 26.71,
     "end_sec": 28.075,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-19",
     "text": "Test accounts mixed in with real people.",
     "start_sec": 28.355,
     "end_sec": 30.808,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-20",
     "text": "Dates written three different ways.",
     "start_sec": 31.088,
     "end_sec": 33.051,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-21",
     "text": "Count people from a broken list, and you're counting the wrong room.",
     "start_sec": 33.331,
     "end_sec": 36.851,
     "context_point_id": null
    }
   ],
   "audio_duration_sec": 37.251,
   "segment_combined_audio_url": "static/kickoff/spotify-v4/problem.mp3",
   "film_at": 32.325
  },
  {
   "id": "outcome",
   "seq": 3,
   "label": "Outcome",
   "cues": [],
   "lines": [
    {
     "line_id": "v4-22",
     "text": "So what does good look like?",
     "start_sec": 0.4,
     "end_sec": 2.043,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-23",
     "text": "One recommendation.",
     "start_sec": 2.323,
     "end_sec": 3.709,
     "context_point_id": "one_recommendation"
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-24",
     "text": "Not three options, and not a maybe.",
     "start_sec": 3.989,
     "end_sec": 6.208,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-25",
     "text": "One market, one new price, and the numbers that prove it's worth the people you lose.",
     "start_sec": 6.488,
     "end_sec": 11.288,
     "context_point_id": "back_it_up"
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-26",
     "text": "A call you'd defend in front of leadership.",
     "start_sec": 11.568,
     "end_sec": 13.936,
     "context_point_id": null
    }
   ],
   "audio_duration_sec": 14.336,
   "segment_combined_audio_url": "static/kickoff/spotify-v4/outcome.mp3",
   "film_at": 69.576
  },
  {
   "id": "process",
   "seq": 4,
   "label": "Process",
   "cues": [],
   "lines": [
    {
     "line_id": "v4-27",
     "text": "You'll get there in five stages.",
     "start_sec": 0.4,
     "end_sec": 2.235,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-28",
     "text": "First, you clean the data. That's about fifteen minutes, and once you've found the problems, Claude does the heavy lifting.",
     "start_sec": 2.515,
     "end_sec": 9.32,
     "context_point_id": "clean_dataset"
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-29",
     "text": "Second, the revenue model. Twenty-five minutes. That's the big one, where you count every room.",
     "start_sec": 9.6,
     "end_sec": 15.125,
     "context_point_id": "revenue_model"
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-30",
     "text": "Third, you make the call.",
     "start_sec": 15.405,
     "end_sec": 16.835,
     "context_point_id": "make_recommendation"
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-31",
     "text": "Fourth, you write the memo.",
     "start_sec": 17.115,
     "end_sec": 18.715,
     "context_point_id": "pricing_memo"
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-32",
     "text": "And last, you present it.",
     "start_sec": 18.995,
     "end_sec": 20.659,
     "context_point_id": "present_it"
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-33",
     "text": "About eighty minutes, start to finish.",
     "start_sec": 20.939,
     "end_sec": 23.029,
     "context_point_id": null
    }
   ],
   "audio_duration_sec": 23.429,
   "segment_combined_audio_url": "static/kickoff/spotify-v4/process.mp3",
   "film_at": 83.912
  },
  {
   "id": "outro",
   "seq": 5,
   "label": "Outro",
   "cues": [],
   "lines": [
    {
     "line_id": "v4-34",
     "text": "And you're not doing this alone. I'm right here the whole way, so if you get stuck, just ask me.",
     "start_sec": 0.4,
     "end_sec": 5.968,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-35",
     "text": "Alright. Let's go find the room where nobody leaves.",
     "start_sec": 6.248,
     "end_sec": 9.15,
     "context_point_id": null
    },
    {
     "line_id": "v4-36",
     "text": "Open the export, and tell me the first thing that looks wrong.",
     "start_sec": 9.43,
     "end_sec": 12.779,
     "context_point_id": null
    }
   ],
   "audio_duration_sec": 12.779,
   "segment_combined_audio_url": "static/kickoff/spotify-v4/outro.mp3",
   "film_at": 107.341
  }
 ]
}